{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983520/extras/53297771ceb4187340631ad1ffb2a8c0.avif?t=1756791715\" width=1560 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mindloop is a time focused puzzle game about deducing a password under pressure. Observe the scene, gather clues, solve quick micro puzzles, and combine what you learn to enter the correct code and disarm the device.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 40 second runs that reward focus and mastery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Micro puzzles across math, logic, patterns, and ciphers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Layered clues that merge into a multi digit code</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Iterative deduction where each attempt teaches you more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Achievements and escalating cases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983520?t=1756791715","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983520?t=1756791715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983520/449013e139baac38a49ef68149642d4bac868a9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756791715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983520/449013e139baac38a49ef68149642d4bac868a9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756791715","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983520/extras/53297771c